{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tiny soul on difficult mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, little souls lived in harmony in the Forest of Eternal Blossom. One day, everything has changed. The Evil Bug King attacked the forest and kidnapped all the little souls! Cik, the only survivor of the attack, embarks on a difficult mission to rescue his loved ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various platforming challenges with a twist. As you posses the ability to fly, the challenge changes to maintaining it. Stay close to plants to regain energy. Bloom flowers to change the environment. Gather followers on whom your abilities depend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various platforming challenges with limited ability to fly. Playing as Cik, you can fly freely as long as you stick close to plants. As the environment becomes more deadly, it becomes harder to find one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloom flowers to change the environment. Different type of flowers create different results. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue friendly souls during your journey. As they start following Cik, you can order them to fly in a chosen direction, to get to places you otherwise couldn't reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different power-ups that will help you move around. As you gather more followers, your abilities will became more powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the colorful world, filled with obstacles to overcome. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/fac51d530e7e9603f272c8a49e11ba5b.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/36788250a2418af2601b407357afc4c5.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/da2a7c659ca3ec8f1399b103a53789d0.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3497510?t=1764800082","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3497510?t=1764800082","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/ff8f7ab81b9afdfb2c2a14bad5db45a3dd20c589/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764800082","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/ff8f7ab81b9afdfb2c2a14bad5db45a3dd20c589/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764800082","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tiny soul on difficult mission</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, little souls lived in harmony in the Forest of Eternal Blossom. One day, everything has changed. The Evil Bug King attacked the forest and kidnapped all the little souls! Cik, the only survivor of the attack, embarks on a difficult mission to rescue his loved ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various platforming challenges with a twist. As you posses the ability to fly, the challenge changes to maintaining it. Stay close to plants to regain energy. Bloom flowers to change the environment. Gather followers on whom your abilities depend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve various platforming challenges with limited ability to fly. Playing as Cik, you can fly freely as long as you stick close to plants. As the environment becomes more deadly, it becomes harder to find one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloom flowers to change the environment. Different type of flowers create different results. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue friendly souls during your journey. As they start following Cik, you can order them to fly in a chosen direction, to get to places you otherwise couldn't reach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different power-ups that will help you move around. As you gather more followers, your abilities will became more powerful.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the colorful world, filled with obstacles to overcome. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/fac51d530e7e9603f272c8a49e11ba5b.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/36788250a2418af2601b407357afc4c5.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/extras/da2a7c659ca3ec8f1399b103a53789d0.avif?t=1764800082\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["KBeet Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3497510/108df66ee37718db9a4ac5aaa93fd5838106c636/header.jpg?t=1764800082","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong